{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/9e958d03887c1061b6e859070510413c.poster.avif?t=1762778019\" width=348 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/9e958d03887c1061b6e859070510413c.webm?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/9e958d03887c1061b6e859070510413c.mp4?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, you're the new manager? Pleased to meet you! <i>Chirp!~</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's work together on making our very own cafe, where all of our bird friends can come relax, enjoy tasty snacks and have a great time! <i>Can you help me figure out every bird's favorite snacks?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/f33981346724398667f906f4bfd2f85c.avif?t=1762778019\" width=1024 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn recipes:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your menu selection over time by re-investing your earnings into more profitable snacks and drinks. From matcha lattes to strawberry shortcakes, help Chef Cafe become the best at their craft!<br><br><strong>Stock up on food:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep a steady supply of food at the ready, so that your bird friends can keep ordering to their heart's content!<br><br><strong>Invite your bird friends:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When everything is ready, send your invitations and watch your hard work pay off as your friends enjoy the wonderful snacks and drinks you've prepared for them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/3a75f75a496be89c686c8094591e1923.poster.avif?t=1762778019\" width=520 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/3a75f75a496be89c686c8094591e1923.webm?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/3a75f75a496be89c686c8094591e1923.mp4?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/3b4c2050cf020d5ae35c1d1357a71d42.avif?t=1762778019\" width=1024 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cafe Cafe features a gacha system with\u00a0<strong>NO micro-transactions</strong>\u00a0whatsoever, so you can enjoy fun surprises completely stress-free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the meals you serve both grant you <strong>coins</strong>\u00a0(which you can use to progress through the game) and<strong> gems</strong>\u00a0(which you can use for the gacha). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend a varied and colorful cast of adorable birds and dress them up with cute accessories and outfits, all through this <strong>cozy take on gacha mechanics</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/61688936a0e7e9b964493aec23e144c0.poster.avif?t=1762778019\" width=250 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/61688936a0e7e9b964493aec23e144c0.webm?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/61688936a0e7e9b964493aec23e144c0.mp4?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Gameplay:</strong>\u00a0stock up on food and send out your invitations, then watch as your birds place their orders and eat at their own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable Bird Friends:</strong>\u00a0collect a variety of charming birds, and dress them up with adorable outfits and accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gacha with NO micro-transactions:</strong>\u00a0experience the thrill of gacha without spending any additional money!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression:</strong>\u00a0use your earnings to expand your cafe, grow your menu and meet new birds to invite</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong>\u00a0unlock a large variety of items to decorate your cafe to your own tastes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle minigame:</strong>\u00a0solve unlimited fun puzzles as much as you like, to gain rewards that accelerate the idle experience</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Cafe Cafe!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979710/12d7dec69fe5f7331f54b9858af55bf609447c62.jpg"},{"name":"Matcha Latte Coming Right Up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979710/40abdaadee51774948dd8e1db43b8403991c0f5b.jpg"},{"name":"The Usual?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3979710/1968825a4f103d7b31afa17e3a2d850cc466f745.jpg"},{"name":"Ma